{"parentUuid":"f05c1f69-604b-4f47-9bb5-f6fd1c7b3e70","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"06427873bfafe27ecf7c9c68a422ce6f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n在 Mac 上运行 Ubuntu 有几种方式：\n\n**1. 虚拟机（推荐）**\n- 使用 **VirtualBox**（免费）或 **UTM**（免费，更适合 Apple Silicon）\n- 安装简单，一键启动，macOS 和 Ubuntu 同时运行\n\n**2. 双系统启动（Boot Camp）**\n- 仅限 Intel Mac\n- 通过 Boot Camp Assistant 分区安装\n- 需要重启切换系统\n\n**3. 云服务器**\n- 如果只是需要 Linux 环境，可以租用云服务器（如 AWS、阿里云）\n\n**推荐方案：**\n- Apple Silicon Mac → 使用 **UTM**\n- Intel Mac → 使用 **VirtualBox** 或 **UTM**\n\n需要我帮你安装虚拟机吗？"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20128,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":2432,"output_tokens":187,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"92fba8b0-853d-4d00-8133-241b0ee741d0","timestamp":"2026-04-30T12:05:14.866Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"627524c6-7a35-4e60-82d9-65e33bd00ea5","version":"2.1.121","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
