{"parentUuid":"cfe967d0-d84d-4f87-977f-1adc2f04f8dd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"0642789e2bfb4fb87c98e3454dda1dd1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nApple Silicon 是苹果自研的 ARM 架构芯片，用于替代 Intel 处理器。\n\n**主要型号：**\n- **M1**（2020 年发布）\n- **M2、M3、M4**（后续迭代）\n\n**覆盖产品线：**\n- MacBook Air、MacBook Pro\n- Mac Mini、Mac Studio、iMac\n- Mac Pro\n\n**优势：**\n- 性能强、功耗低\n- 统一内存架构，效率高\n- 支持 iOS/iPadOS 应用\n\n**如何判断你的 Mac 是否是 Apple Silicon：**\n- 菜单栏 → 点击苹果 logo → 关于此 Mac\n- 显示\"芯片\"而不是\"处理器\"就是 Apple Silicon"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":187,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":22528,"output_tokens":158,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"cd8de659-79b6-44d0-b54d-4a3b4b727df9","timestamp":"2026-04-30T12:05:57.119Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"627524c6-7a35-4e60-82d9-65e33bd00ea5","version":"2.1.121","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
