{"parentUuid":"0c449188-724e-4f09-b5f1-062c86101c07","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"0642887950816993dbac5d47fda7f686","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**Mac 终端常用快捷键：**\n\n| 快捷键 | 功能 |\n|--------|------|\n| `Ctrl + A` | 光标跳到行首 |\n| `Ctrl + E` | 光标跳到行尾 |\n| `Ctrl + U` | 删除光标前所有内容 |\n| `Ctrl + K` | 删除光标后所有内容 |\n| `Ctrl + W` | 删除光标前一个单词 |\n| `Ctrl + C` | 终止当前命令 |\n| `Ctrl + Z` | 暂停当前命令（可 fg 恢复） |\n| `Ctrl + L` | 清屏（相当于 clear） |\n| `Ctrl + D` | 退出当前终端会话 |\n| `Tab` | 自动补全命令/文件名 |\n| `↑ / ↓` | 浏览命令历史 |\n\n**启动终端：**\n- `Command + Space` → 搜索\"终端\"\n- 或 `Command + Tab` 切换到终端"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":20503,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":2368,"output_tokens":223,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"6522b8f7-f5b0-473e-8467-213c21826cef","timestamp":"2026-04-30T13:13:38.367Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"627524c6-7a35-4e60-82d9-65e33bd00ea5","version":"2.1.121","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
