{"parentUuid":"b80f9c9c-9453-49c5-af6f-a81dc030452a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"064288adac466d5ebf71d152df7a9b43","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问如何在Mac上快速打开终端。这是一个简单的问题，我可以直接给出几种方法。\n","signature":"726fc7dfebca31c88f44b45ce11737fe2fe98c45ea65ba8c0f04d3585cbc9001"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":235,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":22848,"output_tokens":126,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"53eaaf63-932b-410c-b026-98e43334be81","timestamp":"2026-04-30T13:14:27.549Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"627524c6-7a35-4e60-82d9-65e33bd00ea5","version":"2.1.121","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"53eaaf63-932b-410c-b026-98e43334be81","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"064288adac466d5ebf71d152df7a9b43","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**快速打开终端的方法：**\n\n1. **快捷键**\n   - `Command + Space` → 输入\"终端\"或\"Terminal\"\n   - 按回车打开\n\n2. **程序坞**\n   - 固定到程序坞后，点击图标即可\n\n3. **启动台**\n   - `Command + Space` → 输入\"启动台\" → 找到终端\n\n**推荐：** 第一次打开后，在程序坞右键终端 → 保持打开，这样下次 `Command + Tab` 就能快速切换。"}],"model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":235,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":22848,"output_tokens":126,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard"},"type":"assistant","uuid":"90a14020-6b2b-4713-b267-9641a76dcfbb","timestamp":"2026-04-30T13:14:28.688Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/eternal","sessionId":"627524c6-7a35-4e60-82d9-65e33bd00ea5","version":"2.1.121","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
